[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20201000_01_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20201000_01_0012","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20201000_01_0010","text":"………………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20201000_01_0020","text":"（灯织，好像有点不太满意的样子……\n　在我看来状态挺好的啊）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20201000_01_0030","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20201000_01_0031","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20201000_01_0040","text":"灯织"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20201000_01_0050","text":"制作人\n练习室能不能再多用一些时间呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20201000_01_0060","text":"我想尽可能压缩一下，\n今天之后的情况────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20201000_01_0070","text":"等一下，灯织"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20201000_01_0080","text":"……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20201000_01_0090","text":"你想练习我明白\n但『尽可能』怎么看都太过头了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20201000_01_0100","text":"先跟我说说，\n你为什么会有这种想法好吗？"}]
